Similarly, we can use `GT.fmt_image()` to render images by passing `"case2"` as the first argument:

::: {#5eaca417 .cell execution_count=8}
``` {.python .cell-code}
GT(metro_mini2).fmt_image("case2").cols_align(align="right", columns="case2")
